      "content": "but it doesn't feel temporary. it feels final. like the metaphor isn't just a feeling, it's the truth. the path didn't just fail, it ended. and looking out into that canyon, it doesn't look scary... it just looks quiet. so much quieter than the walking. it feels like the only logical place for the story to stop.",
